 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official CodeArtifact API (2018-09-22). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Domains and repositories are configuration metadata: no package, package version, asset, endpoint or authorization token exists, and encryption keys are stored without resolving them. Domains with repositories cannot be deleted; repositoryCount is not reported. Upstream repositories and external connections are refused. ListRepositories across domains, repositoryPrefix, permissions policies, package groups and package APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501 or are refused.",
  "title": "AWS CodeArtifact (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-09-22"
 },
